#: app/Config/email-defaults/failed.php:4
#: app/Config/email-defaults/failed.php:28
msgid "##shop_name## – Payment Failed for Order ###order_id##"
msgstr "##shop_name## – Betaling mislukt voor bestelling ###order_id##"

#. translators: the ##...## tokens are merge placeholders substituted with
#. real order data at send time - keep them verbatim.
#: app/Config/email-defaults/failed.php:6
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hi ##customer_name##,\n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately, we were unable to process the payment for your order ###order_id##. This may have happened due to one of the following reasons:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>The card was declined or had insufficient funds</li>\n"
"    <li>Incorrect card details or billing information</li>\n"
"    <li>The payment was not authorized or timed out</li>\n"
"    <li>A temporary issue with the payment provider</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"Order Summary:\n"
"##product_table##\n"
"Items in Order: ##number_of_items##\n"
"Total Amount: ##order_total##\n"
"\n"
"Your items are still saved. You can retry the payment or place a new order anytime at: ##checkout_page##\n"
"\n"
"Need help? Just reach out – we’re here to support you.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Hi ##customer_name##,\n"
"\n"
"Helaas konden we de betaling voor je bestelling ###order_id## niet verwerken. Dit kan een van de volgende oorzaken hebben:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>De kaart is geweigerd of er was onvoldoende saldo</li>\n"
"    <li>Onjuiste kaartgegevens of factuurinformatie</li>\n"
"    <li>De betaling is niet geautoriseerd of verlopen</li>\n"
"    <li>Een tijdelijk probleem bij de betaalprovider</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"Overzicht bestelling:\n"
"##product_table##\n"
"Artikelen in bestelling: ##number_of_items##\n"
"Totaalbedrag: ##order_total##\n"
"\n"
"Je artikelen zijn nog steeds bewaard. Je kunt de betaling opnieuw proberen of op elk moment een nieuwe bestelling plaatsen via: ##checkout_page##\n"
"\n"
"Hulp nodig? Neem gerust contact op – we helpen je graag.\n"

#. translators: the ##...## tokens are merge placeholders substituted with
#. real order data at send time - keep them verbatim.
#: app/Config/email-defaults/failed.php:30
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"Payment for order ###order_id## from ##customer_name## has failed. The failure may have occurred due to:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Card declined or insufficient funds</li>\n"
"    <li>Invalid card or billing details</li>\n"
"    <li>Unauthorized or timed-out payment</li>\n"
"    <li>A temporary payment gateway issue</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"Order Details:\n"
"##product_table##\n"
"Number of Items: ##number_of_items##\n"
"Total Amount: ##order_total##\n"
"\n"
"The customer may retry payment from: ##checkout_page##\n"
"Please follow up if needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Hallo,\n"
"\n"
"De betaling voor bestelling ###order_id## van ##customer_name## is mislukt. De mislukking kan zijn ontstaan door:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Kaart geweigerd of onvoldoende saldo</li>\n"
"    <li>Ongeldige kaart- of factuurgegevens</li>\n"
"    <li>Niet-geautoriseerde of verlopen betaling</li>\n"
"    <li>Een tijdelijk probleem met de betaalgateway</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"Bestelgegevens:\n"
"##product_table##\n"
"Aantal artikelen: ##number_of_items##\n"
"Totaalbedrag: ##order_total##\n"
"\n"
"De klant kan de betaling opnieuw proberen via: ##checkout_page##\n"
"Volg dit indien nodig op.\n"

