msgid "Welcome to ##shop_name## - You're All Set!"
msgstr "Welkom bij ##shop_name## - Je bent helemaal klaar!"

#. translators: the ##...## tokens are merge placeholders substituted with
#. real account data at send time - keep them verbatim.
#: app/Config/email-defaults/new_account.php:6
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hi ##customer_name##,\n"
"\n"
"Welcome to ##shop_name##! We're so glad you're here. Your account is ready to go.\n"
"\n"
"With your account you can:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Track and manage your orders in one place</li>\n"
"    <li>Browse your full purchase history</li>\n"
"    <li>Download digital purchases anytime</li>\n"
"    <li>Check out quicker next time</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"One quick step - please set your password to secure your account:\n"
"##password_reset_link##\n"
"\n"
"Then you're ready to start shopping: ##shop_page##\n"
"\n"
"Thanks for joining us. We hope you find exactly what you're looking for!\n"
"\n"
"Warm regards,\n"
"The ##shop_name## Team\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Hi ##customer_name##,\n"
"\n"
"Welkom bij ##shop_name##! We zijn blij dat je er bent. Je account is klaar voor gebruik.\n"
"\n"
"Met je account kun je:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Je bestellingen op één plek volgen en beheren</li>\n"
"    <li>Je volledige aankoopgeschiedenis bekijken</li>\n"
"    <li>Digitale aankopen op elk moment downloaden</li>\n"
"    <li>De volgende keer sneller afrekenen</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"Nog één snelle stap - stel je wachtwoord in om je account te beveiligen:\n"
"##password_reset_link##\n"
"\n"
"Daarna kun je beginnen met winkelen: ##shop_page##\n"
"\n"
"Bedankt dat je je bij ons hebt aangesloten. We hopen dat je precies vindt wat je zoekt!\n"
"\n"
"Met vriendelijke groet,\n"
"Het team van ##shop_name##\n"

